  "New figurine recipes: Black Division and Wedge": "Nové figurkové recepty: Black Division a Wedge",
  "In 66 mins the Black Division Operator figurine returns a Siege-R plate carrier, the Team Leader figurine an LV-119 plate carrier and the Wedge figurine a CS gas grenade.": "Za 66 minut vrátí figurka Black Division Operator plátový nosič Siege-R, figurka Team Leader plátový nosič LV-119 a figurka Wedge plynový granát CS.",
  "New rituals found: in 66 mins the Black Division Operator figurine returns a First Spear Siege-R plate carrier, the Black Division Team Leader figurine returns a Spiritus Systems LV-119 plate carrier (Black Division V1) and the Wedge figurine returns a Model 8230 CS gas grenade. {view}": "Nalezeny nové rituály: za 66 minut vrátí figurka Black Division Operator plátový nosič First Spear Siege-R, figurka Black Division Team Leader plátový nosič Spiritus Systems LV-119 (Black Division V1) a figurka Wedge granát Model 8230 CS gas grenade. {view}",
